# Slumbering Trudge with X = 3 (four Moxen): three minus three is no stun counters, and X is not 2 or less, so it enters untapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Slumbering Trudge
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Slumbering Trudge.Cast(X: 3)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Slumbering Trudge.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Slumbering Trudge.Counters.Stun = (absent)
